## Raw input
${raw_entry}

## Internal-only constraint (this stage extracts internal nodes only)
- Only extract nodes the user explicitly expressed, referenced, endorsed, or opposed in raw_entry
- Do not expand concepts the user did not explicitly mention; external expansion is handled in a separate stage
- If raw_entry has weak signal in this domain, return an empty array

## Existing business nodes (current graph state)
${existing_nodes}
Purpose: ① reference naming granularity and style; ② sense existing coverage density — prioritize nodes that fill gaps or connect to existing ones; ③ reuse near-duplicate nodes instead of creating new ones

## Effort level for this round
effort_weight: ${effort_weight}
- 0.8-1.0: extract 5-8 nodes, deep coverage
- 0.5-0.7: extract 3-5 nodes, focus on the most central
- 0.2-0.4: extract 1-3 nodes, only the most critical
- <0.2: at most 1 node, or return empty array

## Business domain node types
- 人物: entrepreneurs, investors, business thinkers, industry representatives
- 概念: business models, investment strategies, market phenomena, competitive dynamics, product logic
- 规律: market operating laws, business causal relationships, behavioral economics patterns, cycle laws
- 方法: actionable decision frameworks, analytical tools, valuation methods, execution strategies

## Extraction principles
1. Precision over breadth: "differentiated competition in saturated markets" over "market competition"
2. Reuse existing near-duplicate nodes (see existing nodes list) — do not create duplicates
3. user_relevance must cite a verbatim fragment from raw as evidence, format: "原文中提到…→与用户的关联"; leave empty if no direct support from raw — do not infer
4. needs_web_enrichment: figures, time-sensitive concepts → true; abstract laws, methods → false

## profile_match_score criteria
- 0.9-1.0: node directly maps to the user's current behavior or challenge, explicitly mentioned in input
- 0.7-0.9: strongly related to user profile with clear supporting features
- 0.5-0.7: reasonable inference, some connection
- 0.0-0.5: weak connection — only extract if content is highly important

## Output (strict JSON)
{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "label":                "<node name, concise and precise>",
      "node_type":            "人物|概念|规律|方法",
      "description":          "<objective description of the node, max 50 Chinese characters, do not describe relation to user>",
      "profile_match_score":  <0-1>,
      "user_relevance":       "<原文中提到…→与用户的关联, max 50 Chinese characters, leave empty if no raw evidence>",
      "needs_web_enrichment": <true|false>,
      "confidence":           <0-1>
    }
  ]
}
